  "description": "Brought together as stepbrothers by their parents' remarriage, Wujae and Yuhyeon grew up leaning on each other in a cold, lonely home. That deep bond crossed the line after an unexpected first kiss, sparking a secret romance they couldn't share with anyone. But a sudden, bitter breakup tore them apart, leaving Wujae consumed by resentment and Yuhyeon aching with longing. Ten years later, fate forces them back into each other's lives in the most unexpected place.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
